Third-party assets
------------------

New Computer Modern Math (`crates/soma-cli/assets/NewCMMath-Regular.otf`) is
distributed under the GUST Font License. The licence text is at
`crates/soma-cli/assets/GUST-FONT-LICENSE.txt`. This is the only font binary in
the repository.

The metric tables (`crates/soma-metrics/data/noto-cjk.smt`,
`examples/book/metrics-lxgw.smt` and `examples/templates/plex.smt`) contain
integer measurements only, with no font outlines. They were generated from
Noto Serif CJK SC, Noto Sans CJK SC, LXGW WenKai and IBM Plex Sans SC, all
distributed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, and New Computer Modern Math
(GUST Font License). The measurement data is redistributed here under the
project's Apache-2.0 licence with the source provenance recorded in
`PROVENANCE.md`.

The browser Studio's GB2312 subsets are generated at deploy time from IBM Plex
Sans SC, Noto Sans Mono and New Computer Modern Math; they are not committed.
The hosted demo loads them as static files.

The evaluation corpus under `corpus/` is licensed under CC-BY-4.0; see
`corpus/README.md`. Public-domain classical excerpts keep their public-domain
status.
